abstract: >-
  An interactive academic policy-design prototype exploring proportionate
  intervention design under heterogeneous starting conditions and incomplete
  evidence, using territorial public self-government in the Voronezh Region
  as an illustrative case application.
keywords:
  - adaptive governance
  - public policy
  - community self-governance
  - citizen participation
  - decision-making under uncertainty
  - institutional design
